he Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nJoe's biggest hobby is taking pictures of birds. He had been trying to spot a rare type of bird, called the bluebird, for months. After numerous attempts, he finally spotted one sitting on a tree branch and was delighted. So, he sat down and prepared his camera to take the photo, but as he wanted to take the picture, the bird flew away. As Joe was staying there staring at the empty branch, the bird flew back.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Joe ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Delight\nB) Disappointment\nC) Anger\nD) Pessimism\nE) Remorse\nF) Anticipation\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Joe feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) He has a new camera\nB) He just likes sitting outside\nC) He finally gets to take pictures of the bird he was looking for\nD) He enjoys sitting on a tree branch.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007577242724564895,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e2d6006945d280aac1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369762321,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4e051a8367c04cd397e8066d1a360940"}